WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.266 --> 00:00:04.566
Right before their very eyes,

2
00:00:04.633 --> 00:00:09.100
our heroes and Korrina witnessed Mega Lucario out of control!

3
00:00:09.166 --> 00:00:14.833
Then Korrina’s grandfather, Gurkinn, also known as the Mega Evolution guru,

4
00:00:14.899 --> 00:00:19.900
gave Korrina a brand new trial, travel to Pomace Mountain to visit a Trainer

5
00:00:19.966 --> 00:00:22.166
who also has a Mega-Evolved Pokémon.

6
00:00:22.233 --> 00:00:25.366
And our heroes are going along as well!

7
00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:28.233
Way to go, Pikachu! Thunderbolt, let’s go!

8
00:00:28.299 --> 00:00:30.866
- Pika!
- Lucario, dodge it!

9
00:00:30.933 --> 00:00:35.633
- Pikachu!
- That was awesome!

10
00:00:35.699 --> 00:00:39.566
Now use Bone Rush!

11
00:00:39.633 --> 00:00:42.566
- Pika!
- Dodge it! Quick!

12
00:00:42.633 --> 00:00:43.966
Iron Tail!

13
00:00:44.033 --> 00:00:45.766
Chu!

14
00:00:45.833 --> 00:00:47.133
-Pika!

15
00:00:47.199 --> 00:00:49.800
Using Power-Up Punch was a good choice!

16
00:00:49.866 --> 00:00:53.433
Oh! Oh, no! Oh, no! We can’t keep doing this!

17
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:57.266
-Pi... Pika?

18
00:01:00.833 --> 00:01:05.533
Okay! That’s enough training for now! Clemont says lunch is ready.

19
00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:08.000
- It's time to eat!
- Yes, lunch!

20
00:01:08.066 --> 00:01:11.933
Food break! Why don’t we pick this up after we’re through?

21
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.766
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

22
00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:18.500
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

23
00:01:18.566 --> 00:01:21.100
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

24
00:01:21.166 --> 00:01:24.200
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

25
00:01:24.266 --> 00:01:27.300
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

26
00:01:27.366 --> 00:01:30.200
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

27
00:01:30.266 --> 00:01:33.933
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

28
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:36.600
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

29
00:01:36.666 --> 00:01:38.866
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

30
00:01:38.933 --> 00:01:41.933
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

31
00:01:54.433 --> 00:01:57.800
Man! You’re the best chef in the whole world!

32
00:01:57.866 --> 00:01:59.933
Hey! I helped, you know?

33
00:02:00.066 --> 00:02:02.600
You, too. Thanks a lot!

34
00:02:02.666 --> 00:02:06.666
Oh, yeah! I made the Poké Puffs Lucario likes so much!

35
00:02:06.733 --> 00:02:09.199
Really? That’s great. Thanks!

36
00:02:09.266 --> 00:02:11.333
Here you go. Eat all you want!

37
00:02:16.633 --> 00:02:18.366
-Lucario likes it!

38
00:02:18.433 --> 00:02:20.900
- That makes me so happy!
- Pika!

39
00:02:20.966 --> 00:02:23.200
- Na-na-na!
- I have some for you, too!

40
00:02:23.266 --> 00:02:24.299
- Pika!
- Na-na-na!

41
00:02:24.366 --> 00:02:28.533
Hey, Korrina, you’ve been with Lucario since you were really little, right?

42
00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:32.200
That’s right. But back then, it was still a Riolu.

43
00:02:32.266 --> 00:02:34.566
So what kind of training have you done so far?

44
00:02:34.633 --> 00:02:36.166
Well, you know...

45
00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:41.166
The Shalour Gym is a Fighting-type Gym,

46
00:02:41.233 --> 00:02:45.833
so Trainers and Pokémon alike work hard because we have to be really strong.

47
00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:48.400
I’ve battled Grandfather’s Lucario lots of times.

48
00:02:48.466 --> 00:02:51.833
Wow! That sounds like it's very good training for you.

49
00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:55.033
Yeah, I guess. Grandfather’s also introduced me

50
00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:57.266
to so many Trainers in the process.

51
00:02:57.333 --> 00:02:58.400
Awesome!

52
00:02:58.466 --> 00:03:02.866
And there was even a Trainer who had a Pokémon that could Mega Evolve. Really!

53
00:03:02.933 --> 00:03:06.333
- No way! What kind of Pokémon was it?
- Pi! Pika, Pika!

54
00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:09.433
I remember it was an Ampharos.

55
00:03:10.899 --> 00:03:14.799
- Wow, so Ampharos can Mega Evolve, too?
- Uh-huh.

56
00:03:14.866 --> 00:03:17.033
Whoa! How cool is that?

57
00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:19.799
A Mega Ampharos sounds totally fascinating.

58
00:03:19.866 --> 00:03:22.866
- I’d love to meet it!
- Me, too!

59
00:03:22.933 --> 00:03:25.766
Pikachu!

60
00:03:25.833 --> 00:03:28.899
Oh, so there’s a Mega Ampharos out there.

61
00:03:28.966 --> 00:03:31.133
Interesting, nice plot development.

62
00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:33.166
I want to Mega Evolve, too!

63
00:03:33.233 --> 00:03:36.233
There’s just got to be some Meowthite laying around somewhere

64
00:03:36.299 --> 00:03:37.600
waiting for little old me.

65
00:03:37.666 --> 00:03:40.933
With Lucario, the Lucarionite and the Key Stone,

66
00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.333
we’ll form the foundation of a mega takeover.

67
00:03:43.399 --> 00:03:46.666
Which would form some newfound respect from the Boss.

68
00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:54.266
It looks like this cave is a shortcut to Pomace Mountain.

69
00:03:54.333 --> 00:03:57.766
Sounds good! Come on. Let's go!

70
00:04:03.933 --> 00:04:05.600
Huh?

71
00:04:05.666 --> 00:04:07.833
Ah, which way should we go?

72
00:04:07.899 --> 00:04:12.000
It’s like a maze in here! If we lose our way, we’re in trouble!

73
00:04:12.066 --> 00:04:15.733
No problem! If we trust our instincts, we’ll be fine!

74
00:04:15.799 --> 00:04:18.033
- It’s this way!
- Hey, wait for us!

75
00:04:22.666 --> 00:04:27.366
According to this, there appears to be a large population of Noibat in this cave.

76
00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:30.266
Noibat, eh? Let’s think this through.

77
00:04:30.333 --> 00:04:32.500
Ah! I just got a great idea!

78
00:04:32.566 --> 00:04:34.433
Sounds like the way to go.

79
00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.666
A perfect plan, to say the least!

80
00:04:36.733 --> 00:04:39.099
Excuse me. I haven’t said anything yet.

81
00:04:39.166 --> 00:04:43.366
- Noi!
- Huh?

82
00:04:43.433 --> 00:04:46.233
Okay, Inkay!

83
00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:49.233
Inkay! Inkay!

84
00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:52.500
I want you to scare the daylights out of that Noibat!

85
00:04:52.566 --> 00:04:57.700
Accomplish that with Psybeam!

86
00:04:57.766 --> 00:05:00.566
Noi, Noi! Bat!

87
00:05:06.666 --> 00:05:10.033
- Huh?

88
00:05:10.099 --> 00:05:12.000
- Huh? What's that?

89
00:05:13.566 --> 00:05:16.099
Noibat, the Sound Wave Pokémon.

90
00:05:16.166 --> 00:05:18.333
Noibat’s ears emit ultrasonic waves

91
00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:22.733
that can disturb its prey’s sense of hearing and damage opponents.

92
00:05:25.599 --> 00:05:28.966
It bit me! Ouch!

93
00:05:29.033 --> 00:05:30.833
Pikachu!

94
00:05:38.233 --> 00:05:40.533
What was that all about?

95
00:05:40.599 --> 00:05:43.266
- Hey, where’s Pikachu?
- And where’s Clemont?

96
00:05:43.333 --> 00:05:44.500
Korrina’s gone, too!

97
00:05:44.566 --> 00:05:47.099
Pik, Pik! Pikapi?

98
00:05:47.166 --> 00:05:49.466
Where’s Lucario?!

99
00:05:49.533 --> 00:05:51.599
Huh? Bonnie’s gone!

100
00:05:53.533 --> 00:05:57.933
- Hey! Pikachu!
- Clemont!

101
00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:01.266
Korrina!

102
00:06:03.766 --> 00:06:06.366
Clemont!

103
00:06:06.433 --> 00:06:09.566
- I think we should go this way.
- Ash, wait a minute!

104
00:06:09.633 --> 00:06:13.066
Remember, it’s like a maze in here and we could get totally lost!

105
00:06:13.133 --> 00:06:14.700
Everybody else might be outside,

106
00:06:14.766 --> 00:06:17.299
so I think we should go out and take a look first.

107
00:06:17.366 --> 00:06:19.166
Yeah, you’re right.

108
00:06:20.166 --> 00:06:23.633
Bonnie! Hello! Are you in here?

109
00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:27.000
- Hey, Lucario?!
- Pikapi!

110
00:06:27.066 --> 00:06:29.066
Where did you go?!

111
00:06:30.566 --> 00:06:32.866
The forest is dangerous at night.

112
00:06:32.933 --> 00:06:35.766
Let’s look for them in the morning.

113
00:06:37.166 --> 00:06:38.833
Lucario.

114
00:06:41.166 --> 00:06:42.799
No sign of them.

115
00:06:42.866 --> 00:06:45.333
And it’s starting to get dark.

116
00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:48.599
I think we’d better look for them first thing in the morning.

117
00:06:48.666 --> 00:06:50.666
I guess so.

118
00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:58.333
With the Noibat causing the twerps all that confusion,

119
00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:02.133
I was sure we’d be able to grab Lucario and the Lucarionite.

120
00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:05.333
But who knew there’d be so many Noibat to deal with?

121
00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:08.400
Guess we got almost as confused as the twerps did.

122
00:07:08.466 --> 00:07:11.966
Although we did manage to separate them.

123
00:07:12.033 --> 00:07:14.033
Huh?

124
00:07:14.099 --> 00:07:18.200
- Sounds like we should call it a day.
- My tummy agrees.

125
00:07:22.533 --> 00:07:26.200
- Does it taste yummy, Dedenne?
- Na-na-na!

126
00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:30.166
Don’t you want your Poké Puff?

127
00:07:30.233 --> 00:07:34.033
At lunch, you seemed to really like them a lot.

128
00:07:35.966 --> 00:07:37.966
Lucario’s worried about Korrina.

129
00:07:38.033 --> 00:07:41.166
I’m sure she’s with Clemont, so she’ll be just fine.

130
00:07:41.233 --> 00:07:43.299
He goofs up, but he also comes through

131
00:07:43.366 --> 00:07:45.666
when times are tough and it really matters.

132
00:07:45.733 --> 00:07:48.033
- That’s for sure!
- Yeah!

133
00:07:57.066 --> 00:08:00.400
- Here. Take this.
- Thank you.

134
00:08:00.466 --> 00:08:03.366
- Pikachu!
- Pik.

135
00:08:03.433 --> 00:08:06.400
I’m guessing you’re worried about Ash, aren’t you?

136
00:08:06.466 --> 00:08:08.299
- Pika.
- Even if you’re worried,

137
00:08:08.366 --> 00:08:12.200
you still have to eat. We’ll look for Ash first thing in the morning, okay?

138
00:08:12.266 --> 00:08:16.666
- Clemont’s right!
- Pikachu.

139
00:08:31.466 --> 00:08:33.933
Lucario.

140
00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:37.033
Hey, Korrina, are you having trouble sleeping?

141
00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:40.033
- Pika!
- No. Well, maybe.

142
00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:43.600
Lucario’s with Ash. I’m sure everything’s fine.

143
00:08:43.666 --> 00:08:47.100
Hm? Uh-huh!

144
00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:53.666
Hm. You said you’ve been together since you were really little, right?

145
00:08:53.733 --> 00:08:59.533
Yeah. When we slept, when we played,

146
00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.966
it was always together.

147
00:09:02.033 --> 00:09:05.100
That never changed, even when Riolu became Lucario.

148
00:09:05.166 --> 00:09:06.833
Pika, Pika!

149
00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:09.766
That sounds exactly like Ash and Pikachu to me.

150
00:09:09.833 --> 00:09:11.833
Well, what do you know!

151
00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:16.266
Thing is, whenever Lucario’s not around, I just can’t sleep.

152
00:09:16.333 --> 00:09:18.500
I understand.

153
00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:20.533
Huh?

154
00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:21.900
Lucario.

155
00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:36.066
Lucario, you’re still up.

156
00:09:36.133 --> 00:09:39.500
Can’t you fall asleep?

157
00:09:39.566 --> 00:09:44.033
But I already told you Korrina’s safe with Clemont. Huh? Hm.

158
00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:48.400
Na-na-na? Na-na-na-na!

159
00:09:56.166 --> 00:09:59.533
You really should get some rest.

160
00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:02.366
- That thing that Grandfather said.
- Huh?

161
00:10:02.433 --> 00:10:05.033
I still don’t understand what he meant.

162
00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:08.100
You mean the thing about Lucario’s aura?

163
00:10:08.166 --> 00:10:11.833
I remember. He said it still wasn’t able to control it yet.

164
00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:14.199
- It was the first time!
- That’s true.

165
00:10:14.266 --> 00:10:16.699
But maybe there’s a reason it didn’t listen

166
00:10:16.766 --> 00:10:19.033
and that’s because it couldn’t hear your voice at all!

167
00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:21.800
Hear my voice?

168
00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:30.633
Oh! Lucario’s aura was so strong

169
00:10:30.699 --> 00:10:33.699
and it was suffering so much, it couldn’t hear me.

170
00:10:33.766 --> 00:10:36.933
- Right.
- It’s just like what Grandfather said.

171
00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:42.000
I thought we understood each other, but I didn’t really know how Lucario felt.

172
00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:04.300
Who’s that Pokémon?

173
00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:11.100
It’s Noibat!

174
00:11:16.033 --> 00:11:19.199
- Fletchling, I choose you!
- Fletchling Fletch!

175
00:11:19.266 --> 00:11:24.199
Fletchling, I want you to go and find Korrina, Clemont and Pikachu!

176
00:11:25.166 --> 00:11:28.666
Now, I think we should start looking for them!

177
00:11:28.733 --> 00:11:30.433
- Okay!
- Pika?

178
00:11:33.566 --> 00:11:35.000
What was that?

179
00:11:35.066 --> 00:11:37.666
Prepare for trouble, mega-size!

180
00:11:37.733 --> 00:11:40.033
And make it double with a mega-surprise!

181
00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:42.500
To protect the world from devastation!

182
00:11:42.566 --> 00:11:45.300
To unite all people within our nation!

183
00:11:45.366 --> 00:11:48.533
To denounce the evils of not evolving!

184
00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:51.833
To extend our reach to the stars revolving!

185
00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:54.199
- Jessie!
- And James!

186
00:11:54.266 --> 00:11:56.966
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

187
00:11:57.033 --> 00:12:00.233
Surrender now or prepare for one overpowering fight!

188
00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:03.466
- Meowth, that’s right!
- Wobbuffet!

189
00:12:04.866 --> 00:12:08.400
- Team Rocket!
- Not you jokers again!

190
00:12:08.466 --> 00:12:11.633
Taking your Key Stone and Pikachu is no joke!

191
00:12:11.699 --> 00:12:14.300
You’re not going to take anything from us!

192
00:12:14.366 --> 00:12:18.466
I’ll make sure of that! Bunnelby, I need your help!

193
00:12:18.533 --> 00:12:19.699
Bunnel!

194
00:12:19.766 --> 00:12:22.500
Inkay, ten-hut!

195
00:12:25.766 --> 00:12:28.333
Pumpkaboo, you too!

196
00:12:30.233 --> 00:12:31.900
Pumpkaboo!

197
00:12:31.966 --> 00:12:34.433
- Don’t forget this dyna duo!
- Huh?

198
00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:38.933
Witness our Mecha Evolution Power-Packed Amplify-A-Rama, Mark Two!

199
00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:42.666
Using a device to amplify a Pokémon’s power is wrong!

200
00:12:42.733 --> 00:12:46.199
Wrong! Proof positive is my powered up Inkay, its way!

201
00:12:46.266 --> 00:12:48.500
Inkay!

202
00:12:48.566 --> 00:12:52.699
- Bunnelby, dodge it!
- Bunn! Bunnelby!

203
00:12:52.766 --> 00:12:55.000
- Are you okay, Bunnelby?
- Bun!

204
00:12:55.066 --> 00:12:59.333
- Pumpkaboo, use Dark Pulse!
- Pumpkaboo!

205
00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:01.800
- Jump as high as you can!
- Bunnel!

206
00:13:03.266 --> 00:13:04.300
Bunnel!

207
00:13:04.366 --> 00:13:06.400
That’s my Pumpkaboo!

208
00:13:06.466 --> 00:13:11.199
- Inkay, Tackle, too!
- Inkay!

209
00:13:12.466 --> 00:13:13.766
Bunnel!

210
00:13:17.566 --> 00:13:19.866
Bunnelby!

211
00:13:19.933 --> 00:13:21.599
Return now!

212
00:13:21.666 --> 00:13:24.599
If only Lucario were here!

213
00:13:24.666 --> 00:13:28.599
La dee dah and hoop dee doo! We’re so glad that we’re not you!

214
00:13:28.666 --> 00:13:30.966
Come on out, Chespin!

215
00:13:32.166 --> 00:13:34.333
- Chespin!
- Use Tackle!

216
00:13:34.400 --> 00:13:37.066
Ches! Pin! Ches!

217
00:13:37.133 --> 00:13:38.333
Dodge, Inkay!

218
00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:39.766
Ches!

219
00:13:39.833 --> 00:13:43.733
My powered-up Fury Swipes!

220
00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:47.466
- Oh, no!
- Plus Shadow Ball!

221
00:13:49.633 --> 00:13:51.133
Pin!

222
00:13:51.199 --> 00:13:52.866
Ches!

223
00:13:52.933 --> 00:13:54.766
- Ah!
- Chespin, no!

224
00:13:54.833 --> 00:13:56.033
- Pikachu!
- Huh?

225
00:13:56.099 --> 00:13:57.400
Pika, Pika! Pikachu!

226
00:13:57.466 --> 00:14:00.233
- Okay, Pikachu. Let’s go!
- Pika!

227
00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:05.000
- All right, Thunderbolt!
- Pika! Chu!

228
00:14:05.066 --> 00:14:06.699
Wobbuffet?

229
00:14:06.766 --> 00:14:09.433
Wobbuffet!

230
00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:11.533
Whoa!

231
00:14:11.599 --> 00:14:15.533
With Amplify-A-Rama, Mark Two, our defenses are too much for you!

232
00:14:15.599 --> 00:14:18.266
- Hm! Chespin, ready to go?
- Chespin!

233
00:14:18.333 --> 00:14:21.533
- Use Pin Missile, now!
- Ches! Pin!

234
00:14:21.599 --> 00:14:24.533
Wobbuffet!

235
00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:29.866
Pikachu! Come on! Use Quick Attack!

236
00:14:29.933 --> 00:14:33.133
- Pik, Pik, Pik, Pik, Pik! Pika?
- Inkay!

237
00:14:33.199 --> 00:14:34.933
New and improved speed, to boot!

238
00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:38.533
- Iron Tail, go!
- Chu! Pika!

239
00:14:38.599 --> 00:14:42.099
- Dodge, quick!
- Pika! Pik!

240
00:14:42.166 --> 00:14:44.466
- Okay, now, Pikachu!
- Pik? Pika!

241
00:14:44.533 --> 00:14:46.533
Shadow Ball!

242
00:14:46.599 --> 00:14:49.900
-Pika!

243
00:14:49.966 --> 00:14:51.933
- Pikachu, no!
- Pika!

244
00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:55.766
I’m sorry. I forgot I have to tell you which move to use or you won’t know!

245
00:14:55.833 --> 00:14:57.333
Pika!

246
00:14:57.400 --> 00:15:00.666
Fletchling! Fletch, Fletch!

247
00:15:01.666 --> 00:15:04.533
Hey, Pikachu! Where are you?

248
00:15:04.599 --> 00:15:08.466
- Korrina!
- Big brother!

249
00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:10.933
Huh?

250
00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:14.666
Lucario, what’s up?

251
00:15:14.733 --> 00:15:17.900
Oh! Wait!

252
00:15:18.966 --> 00:15:20.233
- Chling!
- Huh?

253
00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:22.833
Fletchling! Fletch!

254
00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:25.900
- Did you find them?
- Ling! Fletchling!

255
00:15:25.966 --> 00:15:27.866
Sounds like something happened!

256
00:15:27.933 --> 00:15:30.400
Okay, lead us to where they all are!

257
00:15:30.466 --> 00:15:31.833
Fletch!

258
00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:36.166
- Pumpkaboo, Dark Pulse!
- Pumpkaboo

259
00:15:36.233 --> 00:15:37.633
Chespin!

260
00:15:37.699 --> 00:15:41.633
I’ll cop that Key Stone, please, with my Fury Swipes!

261
00:15:41.699 --> 00:15:43.933
-Korrina!

262
00:15:48.233 --> 00:15:52.366
Oh! Lucario!

263
00:15:52.433 --> 00:15:54.599
- Pikachu!
- Clemont!

264
00:15:54.666 --> 00:15:56.599
- Bonnie!
- Pika! Pi!

265
00:15:56.666 --> 00:15:58.666
Behold the approaching twerps!

266
00:15:58.733 --> 00:16:01.599
We’re not the Team Rocket of days gone by!

267
00:16:02.599 --> 00:16:05.733
Their Pokémon have some weird power-up device.

268
00:16:05.800 --> 00:16:07.800
Okay. Thanks, Clemont.

269
00:16:07.866 --> 00:16:11.266
Pikachu, use Electro Ball and aim for that machine!

270
00:16:11.333 --> 00:16:15.000
Pika! Pika, Pika, Pika, Pika! Pik!

271
00:16:15.066 --> 00:16:16.966
Wobbuffet!

272
00:16:20.033 --> 00:16:22.733
- Isn't this fun?
- Pik...

273
00:16:22.800 --> 00:16:27.233
We can’t get anywhere near them. All of our moves are being deflected back.

274
00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:30.233
Oh, man. So what do we do?

275
00:16:32.166 --> 00:16:35.599
Now? Mega Evolve? I don’t know.

276
00:16:38.666 --> 00:16:40.300
- Korrina!
- Huh?

277
00:16:40.366 --> 00:16:43.400
This might be our only hope!

278
00:16:43.466 --> 00:16:47.500
- This drama’s coming to a close!
- First, the Lucarionite, then cut!

279
00:16:47.566 --> 00:16:50.099
- Do it, Korrina!
- Come on!

280
00:16:51.233 --> 00:16:53.233
Hm. All right.

281
00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:55.833
Lucario, now!

282
00:16:55.900 --> 00:16:58.400
Mega Evolve!

283
00:16:58.466 --> 00:17:01.066
Ha!

284
00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.800
Whoa!

285
00:17:16.033 --> 00:17:19.166
- There it is!
- Mega impressive, indeed!

286
00:17:19.233 --> 00:17:22.033
And perfect to sign to a long-term contract!

287
00:17:22.099 --> 00:17:23.466
Wobbuffet!

288
00:17:23.533 --> 00:17:26.833
All right then, Lucario! Bone Rush!

289
00:17:31.899 --> 00:17:32.833
Inkay!

290
00:17:32.899 --> 00:17:35.333
- Say it isn’t so!
- With power to burn!

291
00:17:35.399 --> 00:17:37.833
- All right, way to go!
- Pika!

292
00:17:39.899 --> 00:17:43.833
- Huh?

293
00:17:47.399 --> 00:17:49.033
Lucario, no!

294
00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:55.566
- Lucario!
- Pika!

295
00:17:58.133 --> 00:18:00.733
- Hm?
- Something’s wrong with this picture.

296
00:18:04.733 --> 00:18:07.133
- Whoa!

297
00:18:10.166 --> 00:18:12.600
- Huh?
- Lucario’s out of control!

298
00:18:12.666 --> 00:18:15.600
Say, I think this is turning into a party!

299
00:18:15.666 --> 00:18:18.200
It's true and they’ve got the noisemaker.

300
00:18:18.266 --> 00:18:20.233
-Stop it, Lucario!

301
00:18:25.733 --> 00:18:30.000
Lucario!

302
00:18:40.266 --> 00:18:45.000
Lucario?

303
00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:58.300
Lucario! Lucario! Lucario!

304
00:18:58.366 --> 00:19:00.766
Huh?

305
00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:08.933
Lucario! Lucario! Lucario!

306
00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:14.233
Lucario! Lucario!

307
00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:19.966
You’ve got to listen to my voice, Lucario!

308
00:19:21.266 --> 00:19:22.899
Huh?

309
00:19:25.366 --> 00:19:29.466
Lucario.

310
00:19:29.533 --> 00:19:31.266
You can hear me!

311
00:19:34.333 --> 00:19:38.266
Hold on. We didn’t sign up for any of this mega mushiness.

312
00:19:38.333 --> 00:19:42.733
Lucario! Use Bone Rush!

313
00:19:47.033 --> 00:19:50.399
All of that power, down the drain!

314
00:19:50.466 --> 00:19:51.899
Oh, the pain and shame!

315
00:19:51.966 --> 00:19:53.700
It always ends the same.

316
00:19:53.766 --> 00:19:58.899
- We’re blasting off again!
- Wobbuffet!

317
00:20:02.133 --> 00:20:05.899
Lucario, I’m so glad you heard my voice!

318
00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:14.500
No. Not again! Oh!

319
00:20:14.566 --> 00:20:16.366
Lucario, you okay?

320
00:20:19.433 --> 00:20:21.600
Oh, good!

321
00:20:21.666 --> 00:20:23.666
They still have a way to go.

322
00:20:23.733 --> 00:20:27.000
They’ll figure it out. I know you two can do it!

323
00:20:27.066 --> 00:20:29.533
Thanks.

324
00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:34.766
After Lucario’s Mega Evolution, its aura again caused a loss of control

325
00:20:34.833 --> 00:20:38.399
and although Mega Lucario was able to hear Korrina’s voice,

326
00:20:38.466 --> 00:20:40.866
it was only for a brief moment.

327
00:20:40.933 --> 00:20:46.233
But Korrina and Lucario will search for a solution, as the journey continues!
